  "scope": "The whole rank lemma of Federer 3.2.21, p. 257: a globally Lipschitz map R^m to R^n has an actual differential of image dimension strictly less than positive mu for L^m almost all points above a purely (H^mu,mu) unrectifiable Borel target. There is no upper bound on mu by source or target dimension, finite mass, selected derivative field or extra rank premise.",
