  "proof_route": "Derive null countably rectifiable images from pure unrectifiability and apply the equal-dimension area formula. Prove an epimorphic Euclidean quotient from independent differential images, then use polar factorisation and existing opaque orthogonal projection charts to select an injective rotated mu-block. Countable metric separability of O(m) and continuity of restricted top Jacobians detect all bad actual ranks by a countable family. Prove the exact actual-differential restricted positivity locus Borel. Every mu-section is null by the equal-dimension case; Fubini gives ambient null mass. Orthogonal null transport and countable union annihilate the entire bad rank locus. Domain-rank bounds handle mu>m; Rademacher supplies actual differentials almost everywhere.",
  "erratum_correction": "Erratum p. 5, book p. 257 line 26: the final contradiction uses L^mu(B)=0, not L^m(B)=0.",
  "coordinate_convention": "The standard last mu-coordinate block is the printed first block after a fixed block interchange."
